# wear/woman/smock_stride: the smock skirt's knee rows in side views, keyed by the legs (motion rebuild, 2026-10-21,
# docs/MOTION_P2.md 7.3). smock_hang.pxm's side rest views stop above row F-6; these views put those rows back for every
# standing leg key the side views draw with hang=rest (pixel for pixel, so idles, postures and swings compose as before),
# and draw the pass keys (walkB2, walkD2) with the hem lifted, so both knees show as the legs cross. GARB (motion rebuild).
# Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
# WOMAN-WEAR (P2B rollout, 2026-10-22): the reach panels fitted to the shipped reach legs (rows of the rest hang carried
# over the leg runs it left as slivers).
use person woman
body woman
role garment smock
layer hangFront
anchor hip
keys legs
z 1

view R key idle origin 6 -4
|59988889887765
|.5555555555555

